extraction_notes: "Rifts World Book 15: Spirit West printed 53-56, read from the text layer. No hit point or S.D.C. formula is printed, so compose.js supplies both (1D6 S.D.C. as a practitioner of magic). P.P.E. prints as 2D4xlO+10 and trade goods as 2D6xlOO, read as 2D4x10+10 and 2D6x100 (BOOK-INGEST-AUDIT F53). Spells: five of the ten Shamanistic Animal spells at level one, the remaining five at level two, then one per level from the printed 55 list (list B). The book caps each later pick at the character''s own level on that list; a named list replaces the spell-level gate in this app, so the cap is a note on each grant rather than enforced. Agony is listed with no P.P.E. figure. Six names use the catalog''s spelling: Breathe Without Air, Negate Poison/Toxin, Swim as a Fish (lesser) (the book''s 6 P.P.E. is the lesser spell''s), Reduce Self (6 inches), and Summon and Control Canines, Rodents and Animals. The +4 to save vs animal venom is in a special ability, because the save block has no animal-specific field and toxins_poisons would over-grant. The totem pick is not stored; see BOOK-INGEST-AUDIT.md F56. The book gives no starting fetishes for this class."
